  background: #f5f5f5;
}

.title {
  margin-top: 20px;
}
A. Move the spacing to padding: put padding-top: 20px; on .title
B. Add margin: 0; to .section
C. Adjacent margins collapse: add overflow: hidden; to .section to establish a block formatting context
D. Add display: inline; to .section
