  display: flex;
}

.name {
  flex: 1;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
A. Add flex-wrap: wrap; to the container so it wraps onto a new line
B. A flex item&#x27;s min-width defaults to auto, so it will not shrink below its content width; set min-width: 0 on the item
C. Add overflow: visible; to the container
D. Add width: 100%; to the item
