次のデスクトップファーストのスタイルシートをレビューする。中程度の画面幅で .card の幅が正しくない。問題はどこか。
.card { width: 25%; }

@media (max-width: 1200px) {
  .card { width: 33.33%; }
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .card { width: 50%; }
}

@media (max-width: 1200px) {
  .card { width: 100%; }
}
A. Media queries cannot be nested and must live in separate files
B. The media queries are out of order: max-width blocks must run from largest to smallest, otherwise the wider breakpoint overwrites the narrower one
C. max-width should be changed to min-width throughout
D. .card should be declared once outside the media queries
