Review this CSS. .btn:hover is supposed to recolour the button on hover, but hovering does nothing. What is wrong?
审查下面这段 CSS：.btn:hover 想让按钮在悬停时变色，但悬停时完全没反应。问题是什么？
次の CSS をレビューする。.btn:hover でボタンの色を変えたいのに、ホバーしても何も起きない。問題はどこか。
#submit {
  background: #1677ff;
}

.btn:hover {
  background: #0958d9;
}
A. :hover only works on anchor elements
B. .btn needs cursor: pointer; for hover to trigger
C. background cannot be changed on hover and background-color must be used instead
